  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "We substitute the options in the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nOption 1) ×, −, =, −\n\n__**12 × 10**__ - 41 = 100 - 61\n\n__**120 - **____**41**__ = __**100 - **____**61**__\n\n79 ≠ 39\n\nOption 2) +, +, =, −\n\n__**12 + 10 + 41**__ = 100 - 61\n\n63 = 100 - 61\n\n63 ≠ 39 \n\nOption 3) ×, +, =, +\n\n__**12 × 10**__ + 41 = 100 + 61\n\n__**120 + **____**41**__ = __**100 + **____**61**__\n\n161 = 161\n\nOption 4) +, =, ×, +\n\n12 + 10 = __**41 × 100**__ + 61\n\n__**12 + **____**10**__ = __400** +**____** 61**__\n\n22 ≠ 461\n\nHence the correct answer is option 3)",
